{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "claude-desktop-mcp-integration",
		"name": "Claude Desktop MCP Integration",
		"description": "Comprehensive test collection for Spring AI with Claude Desktop MCP server integration. This collection demonstrates stunning desktop system integration capabilities through AppleScript automation, multi-server MCP architecture, and natural language processing.\n\n## Features Demonstrated:\n- 🍎 macOS System Control via AppleScript MCP\n- 🔄 Multi-Server Load Balancing\n- 💬 Natural Language to System Action\n- 🛠️ STDIO Transport Implementation\n- 📊 Real-time System Monitoring\n\n## Usage:\n1. Start the Spring Boot application\n2. Ensure you're running on macOS for AppleScript features\n3. Run requests individually or execute the entire collection\n4. Watch for actual system changes (notifications, volume, etc.)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "claude-desktop-mcp"
	},
	"item": [
